<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin says cancels weekly T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin says cancels weekly T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak finance ministry has cancelled this week's T-bill auction, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>This is the third consecutive ministry T-bill auction to be cancelled.</p>
<p>Ministry officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
